NAME
    asm - the on-target two-pass assembler

SYNOPSIS
    asm src.asm out.bin

DESCRIPTION
    Assembles a P8X assembly source file into a binary, entirely on the
    machine -- the on-target counterpart of the host assembler. Pair it
    with edit (or vi) for a self-hosted edit/assemble/run loop. asm is a
    /bin program.

EXAMPLES
    asm hello.asm hello.bin
    run hello.bin

SEE ALSO
    edit, vi, run
